<h2>The case in one view</h2>
<table class="law">
  <tr><th>Case</th><td>Dash Exports Pvt. Ltd. v. Directorate of Enforcement, MISC. APPEAL(PMLA) 4/2026</td></tr>
  <tr><th>Court</th><td>High Court of Delhi, Division Bench (Navin Chawla and Arun Bhardwaj JJ)</td></tr>
  <tr><th>Decided</th><td>6 November 2026 (reserved 13 October 2026)</td></tr>
